":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This issue hosts all relevant work for the sum-check protocol & the Spartan PIOP.\r\n\r\nCurrently, we have defined the specification for a single round of the sum-check protocol. The full sum-check protocol will be obtained by composing all the rounds together. This relies on general results about composition of reductions developed in #1.\r\n\r\nThe following are immediate targets to work on:\r\n\r\n- [ ] Prove perfect completeness of a single sum-check round.\r\n- [ ] Define state function for round-by-round (knowledge) soundness (for a single round).\r\n- [ ] Prove round-by-round (knowledge) soundness (for a single round).\r\n\r\nOnce we finish sum-check, we will start work on formalizing Spartan.","closed_by":{"login":"quangvdao","id":22353552,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzUzNTUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22353552?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao","html_url":"https://github.com/quangvdao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quangvdao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Verified-zkEVM/ArkLib/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"conf